# The payload shelf. `./scripts/build-payloads.sh` stages third-party tool
# artifacts here (linpeas.sh alone is ~800 KB) and SimCore serves them from
# GET /api/k8s/payload/{name}.
#
# Nothing staged is tracked, for two independent reasons: size, and licence —
# these are third-party GPL/MIT artifacts and vendoring them into git history is
# a redistribution posture this repo has not taken. Provenance travels with the
# artifact instead, via MANIFEST.json -> the inventory endpoint -> the manifest
# banner. The image gets its copy because core/Dockerfile COPYs this directory
# at build time, so run the staging script BEFORE `docker build`.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!sources.json
